# Assignment 3.3 Part 2 — compile-time environment config files.
# Both hold per-environment API URLs and feature flags fed into
# `--dart-define-from-file` at build time. Never committed: dev
# lives on the developer's laptop, prod lives in a GitHub Actions
# secret (CONFIG_PROD_JSON) and is materialised only inside the
# release workflow.
config.dev.json
config.prod.json
